Description: Thumbnails of unmarked pictures in the shape of a pair are made again
 stereo-layer 1.17.3 takes an unmarked picture within 2:1 to 3.6:1 for a side by side pair (ORDER 504), so the flat thumbnails cached for such
 pictures are stale. The image and JPEG thumbnailers' versions go up, so cached thumbnails are made again.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
---
--- a/thumbnail/imagethumbnail.json	2026-11-10 16:54:58.000000000 -0300
+++ b/thumbnail/imagethumbnail.json	2026-11-10 17:10:33.668915739 -0300
@@ -75,5 +75,5 @@
         "Name[zh_CN]": "图像 (GIF、PNG、BMP 等)",
         "Name[zh_TW]": "影像 (GIF, PNG, BMP, ...)"
     },
-    "ThumbnailerVersion": "3"
+    "ThumbnailerVersion": "4"
 }
--- a/thumbnail/jpegthumbnail.json	2026-11-10 16:54:58.000000000 -0300
+++ b/thumbnail/jpegthumbnail.json	2026-11-10 17:10:33.674086973 -0300
@@ -49,5 +49,5 @@
         "Name[zh_CN]": "JPEG 图像",
         "Name[zh_TW]": "JPEG 影像"
     },
-    "ThumbnailerVersion": "5"
+    "ThumbnailerVersion": "6"
 }
